== Where the trusted-code budget stands

{{gen:tcb}}

Headroom at the code commit: {{num:tcb.total}} of {{num:tcb.total_cap}} (D-030), with unit A at {{num:tcb.exact}}/{{num:tcb.exact_cap}}. D-033 (sin/cos) is budgeted at "at most ~40 trusted lines in unit A" {{report:reports/APPROVAL_RECORD_2026-11-23_packet3.md}}. Real algebraic numbers were deferred to v2 to stay inside the cap (D-030). The rule that governs every future line: "No trusted check may ever be removed or weakened to fit a cap" {{src:MASTERPLAN.md:434}}.

